    "detailed_description": "Narcotics Ninja is a fast paced action platformer with an emphasis on physics based platforming and high intensity combat. Traverse a variety of levels set in a cyberpunk style environment in which the player takes on the role of a drug runner, who must navigate their way through rival territories and deal with law enforcement.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937970/extras/cf3634bb403edc5004c23d195cfb6a9f.poster.avif?t=1651484297\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937970/extras/cf3634bb403edc5004c23d195cfb6a9f.webm?t=1651484297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937970/extras/cf3634bb403edc5004c23d195cfb6a9f.mp4?t=1651484297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Once you take on the role of the Runner, you will gain access to his toolkit - A minigun, a tool for both dispatching enemies from a distance and navigating your way through the levels; A katana, an effective weapon at close range for instantly destroying most types of enemies; and the shurikens, a throwable weapon for taking enemies out at range.<br><br>On top of all of this, the player will be able to use the <strong><i>Overdrive</i></strong> ability when enough enemies have been destroyed, which slows the passage of time and grants explosive ammunition to the minigun for a short while.",
    "about_the_game": "Narcotics Ninja is a fast paced action platformer with an emphasis on physics based platforming and high intensity combat. Traverse a variety of levels set in a cyberpunk style environment in which the player takes on the role of a drug runner, who must navigate their way through rival territories and deal with law enforcement.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937970/extras/cf3634bb403edc5004c23d195cfb6a9f.poster.avif?t=1651484297\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937970/extras/cf3634bb403edc5004c23d195cfb6a9f.webm?t=1651484297\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1937970/extras/cf3634bb403edc5004c23d195cfb6a9f.mp4?t=1651484297\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br>Once you take on the role of the Runner, you will gain access to his toolkit - A minigun, a tool for both dispatching enemies from a distance and navigating your way through the levels; A katana, an effective weapon at close range for instantly destroying most types of enemies; and the shurikens, a throwable weapon for taking enemies out at range.<br><br>On top of all of this, the player will be able to use the <strong><i>Overdrive</i></strong> ability when enough enemies have been destroyed, which slows the passage of time and grants explosive ammunition to the minigun for a short while.",
